 existed since the BC6 signed mode added in (#96377)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Ubuntu 24.04.2 LTS 24.04 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 SUPER (nvidia; 550.120) - AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen compressing a texture that contain a negative rgb value that is more than -1 it gets clamp to the maximum negative value allowed by half floats. \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/987f73d1-38ea-47b9-833e-0c5a79759642)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Compress a texture that has negative values larger than -1.\n2. Import the texture using the VRAM Compressed mode\n3. Since normally -1.0 and -65504.0 would display the same apply a shader to the texture so that -1.0 would render as -0.5. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[signed-bc6h.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19521379/signed-bc6h.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/10476